#: c7cb5848e2824dfaa09835da928c257d
msgid ""
"A new addition to the TOF rangefinder offering by `TeraBee "
"<https://www.terabee.com/>`__ . This sensor has much longer range (up to 30 "
"meters) and better performance over less reflective surfaces such as grass, "
"making it very suitable for Plane landing, Copter takeoff and landing, and "
"Object Avoidance applications."
msgstr ""
"`TeraBee <https://www.terabee.com/>`__ 推出的 TOF 测距仪系列新品。该传感器测距范围更长（最高 30 "
"米），在草地等低反射率表面上性能更佳，非常适合 Plane 着陆、Copter 起飞降落及避障应用。"

