msgid "As a Plane altitude rangefinder used in auto landings:"
msgstr "用于 Plane 自动降落时的高度测距仪："

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-neo.rst:37
#: 44a58b0dff924c7b8aa876209303e3bc 88992f1eb0a84b6aa41567f7912b6540
#: afc01986ef2f412daf524f92c43f322a d2bced73a0b54b43b62698297d7ed948
#: f98be6ddd9fc4a32a3c7fce34b8f7561
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`RNGFND_LANDING<RNGFND_LANDING>` bits 0 or 1 to enable used of the "
"rangefinder during landing phases of Plane and QuadPlane. The first "
"rangefinder with \"down\" orientation will be used."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`RNGFND_LANDING<RNGFND_LANDING>` 的第 0 位或第 1 位置 1，以在 Plane 和 QuadPlane"
" 降落阶段启用测距仪。将使用方向朝下的第一个测距仪。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-neo.rst:39
#: 01d3d5837ab749e1a67a45017bd3232c 19b4ea2cca5f4ca394b650cc63384a32
