"For Copter and Object Avoidance applications, additional/different "
"parameters will be need to set. See :ref:`common-rangefinder-setup`."
msgstr "对于 Copter 及避障应用，还需要设置额外或不同的参数。请参阅 :ref:`common-rangefinder-setup`。"
